  m_text: "<b>Things You Can Find</b>\n  <color=#FFE07A>Keys</color> - You'll need
    to find 2 to open the Boss Gate.\n  <color=#FFC400>Chests & Gold</color> - Currency
    used at the Shop [Currently Unavailable]\n  <color=#E78464>Campsites</color>
    - Interact with <b>E</b> to heal and revive your party [One Use Only].\n  <color=#68C391>Shrines</color>
    - Interact with <b>E</b> and have a chance to gain a Blessing."
